---
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - runs
defaults: {}
metadata:
  purpose: Index of durable release native verification reports under site/reports
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Release native verification reports</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; max-width: 1000px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.5; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
    th { text-align: left; color: #475569; border-bottom: 2px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 14px; }
    td { border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; font-size: 14px; }
    .fail { color: #991b1b; font-weight: 700; }
    .pass { color: #166534; font-weight: 700; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Release native verification reports</h1>
  <p>Each report is the durable record of the native matrix run that verified a prerelease or published release. Generated {{ generated_at }}.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Report</th><th>Result</th><th>Tag</th><th>Commit</th><th>Triggered by</th><th>Generated</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{% for run in runs %}<tr><td><a href="{{ run.href }}">{{ run.label }}</a></td><td class="{{ run.status_class }}">{{ run.status }}</td><td>{{ run.tag }}</td><td><code>{{ run.commit }}</code></td><td>{{ run.trigger }}</td><td>{{ run.generated_at }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
